{"v":3,"catch":"在屍潮中生存下來\n強化你的角色\n完成關卡","desc":"俯視角戰術塔防遊戲，你不僅可以部署部隊，還能主動操控他們的部署！\n\n王國淪陷於黑暗勢力的蹂躪之下，守衛者們被魔法束縛，無法移動，卻依然可以戰鬥！唯一逃脫詛咒的是主角。如今，只有他才能改變軍隊的部署，調動劍士、弓箭手和其他戰士，擊退一波又一波的敵人。\n\n運用策略，應對新的威脅，購買資源，升級你的軍隊，成為王國的最後希望！","publisher":"Brainium Games","release":"2026-07-02","genres":["策略","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ac0f98900ed79e2f6121604beebd0abdff167aaa2020bb1c3e5694daa151008.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1942c29f3670d67c4c189267966c3363e682720a69f0ec1b7d1ca7f57f6284b2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00cb8a6b4fb432fa1cf41e10c2fc2bd82ac4c2c458a6ef796a719ff247c76ac4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21ff89a20bfb342a2cfb1018b6975faaab69994d1885da127c76c21e7ebb16e3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/63ffd400e1313c767e61b3f4672cdb84cb922000976eb84a0d242d8388e6f500.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/02e5e605ecf55adff9edadd9b6aed1bb9f4f53d2fd3d229447efa1aa05911318.jpg"],"titleId":"01004bb028eb2000","dlc":[]}